{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：中国AI基础设施生态增长空前，约束持续存在</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">中国AI基础设施正在经历一轮罕见的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>一份覆盖芯片、封装、服务器到数据中心和电力设备的全景报告给出一个核心判断：到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>，中国AI基础设施需求的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">80%</span>将由本土芯片满足，而<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2025年</span>这一比例约为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOU0dXKnDMCmxgL1gy81WhYFGgeGlEffkQe7KKc61RsJEiaAKUXHWqHib3rzdpgokBQ3PRXBaT0T5FDeH3bArjvQWWQSpnuFBP44Y/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVIPpLAtYtwK4tB1Nicj47QVbNjVJFeJqibYAPlqqn01AaX2HKcwGImukMYmBzd9yKtkmOB6or9zadpibibDcNsvaxapmElwq5V31I/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWMoX7tXicvSW0u18vxIbFZvfQNiazBwdH59N7YxJ0Ej0mnLvSrKCmlvB6ekoxBDJH7F17iblwk2tcKbynf9qQlBajvH0Ria8c4YC4/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<section style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#737D8C;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">——人工智能免责声明（部分内容由人工智能工具辅助生成）</p><p style=\"margin:0\">撰稿：James<br>责编：KC<br>排版：胡桃</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVHUrk164ktAHRCBQlk7AxePlAgSo0upGQCRdO6S7ZIlDqyDa2g9Lrk9tOJdIUlleypz19biadEQTYewKowR9pD8swsBUUEUFKE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC桌面\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 47-JPM-China AI Infra Ecosystem Unprecedented growth- lingering constraints-260902</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
